Asking a stranger for a photo in Japan? Say this 📸
Short, polite, works everywhere.

Today's phrases:
• しゃしん (shashin) = Photo
• おねがいします (onegaishimasu) = Please (a request)
• どういたしまして (douitashimashite) = You're welcome

